      <profiles>
        <profile name="Weirdboy" id="5409-51dc-0e4d-8936" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">6"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">5+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">50mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Da Jump (Psychic level 1)" id="06e2-2be3-36b0-2d8c" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: During the Movement phase, in your turn, while the unit is not Battle-shocked, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Roll D6, then:
    -&gt; Roll one D6:
      - On 1: The unit is Battle-shocked.
      - On 2-6: Nothing happens.
  -&gt; The unit can be placed into Strategic Reserves.
  -&gt; The unit gains the Deep Strike ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Waaagh! Energy (Psyker level 1)" id="9b73-63d4-1508-1fb0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Nothing happens.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Warpath (Psychic level 1)" id="266d-0dbc-9740-7905" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit is selected to fight, you may use this ability, during the Fight phase, while the unit is not Battle-shocked, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Roll D6, then:
    -&gt; Roll one D6:
      - On 1: The unit is Battle-shocked.
      - On 2-6: Nothing happens.
  -&gt; You can re-roll a Wound roll of 1 with melee weapons.
  -&gt; Melee weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [PSYCHIC].</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="55dc-c8f3-c738-64d2" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Support" id="6f19-5755-25a4-16b7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Nothing happens.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
