      <profiles>
        <profile name="Morkanaut" id="159b-9322-32d4-7ab7" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">9"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">2+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">20</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc">5+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">109x170mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Big an' Shooty" id="35e0-0e7c-b271-0abc" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">During the Shooting phase, in your turn, you can re-roll a Hit roll of 1 with ranged weapons.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Gut Hatch" id="5184-e5a9-74bd-2cee" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends a Normal move, during the Movement phase, in your turn, friendly units embarked within the unit can disembark using the Assault Disembarkation rules.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="9d16-ec5b-5cb7-da12" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="24db-7755-20c5-5836" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Super-heavy Walker" id="40b0-2e96-13d8-dd9e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; This model can move over models excluding titanic and terrain as though they were not there; this model cannot end a move within Engagement Range of any enemy unit, during its Normal, Advance and Fall Back moves.
  If this model moved:
    -&gt; Roll one D6: on exactly 1, the unit is Battle-shocked.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Waaagh!" id="2140-8276-0ba1-58f7" hidden="false" targetId="6ac2-fce9-ef59-43eb" type="rule"/>
