        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="a2a7-ec35-b1fb-570a" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="3"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Big'ed Bossbunka" id="e6b8-9bbb-8461-4e5b" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">3+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">0</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">Hull</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="5e75-5daa-cfd3-ca1a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Fortification" id="1c6c-d335-cab2-6fa3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While an enemy unit is engaged with a friendly FORTIFICATION unit, while an enemy unit is unengaged with a friendly unit (excluding FORTIFICATION units), for the rest of the battle:
  -&gt; Friendly units can target enemy units that are engaged with ranged attacks.
  -&gt; Against ranged attacks, unless against close quarters shooting attacks, the attacking unit gets -1 to Hit rolls with ranged weapons.
  -&gt; When the unit is selected to make a Fall Back move: while the triggering unit is engaged with a friendly FORTIFICATION unit, while the triggering unit is unengaged with a friendly unit (excluding FORTIFICATION units), while the unit is not Battle-shocked, the triggering unit is not affected by Desperate Escape tests.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Ramshackle Cover" id="1451-cc87-897d-75d6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit selects its targets, unless the target is not fully visible to the attacking model because of this unit, until that unit finishes resolving its attacks, the target has the Benefit of Cover.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Raucous Occupants" id="2f7e-b5cb-b984-8209" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the unit is within range of a home objective marker, for the rest of the battle, while this model is within range of a home objective marker, add 1 to this model's Objective Control characteristic for every 1 models in or embarked within this model.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Firing Deck" id="a28d-9c3a-ffd2-76f1" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Firing Deck X ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
