        </profile>
        <profile name="Firing Deck" id="0df9-9618-a146-4268" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Firing Deck X ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="151b-5e91-dc03-07ea" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Pilin' Out" id="0cf8-83df-5485-b037" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time an enemy unit ends a move, during the Movement phase, in the opponent's turn, while the triggering unit is within 8" of this model, friendly units embarked within this model can disembark using the Rapid Disembarkation rules.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
