      <profiles>
        <profile name="Madcap Artillery" id="b5e5-679b-4c0c-bd72" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, if all ranged weapons equipped by each MEK GUNZ model in the unit are the same, until the start of your next turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; If one or more models in this unit are each equipped with one weapon named "Bubblechukka", that unit gains the Bubblechukka ability (this unit is wobbled; while the unit is wobbled, the target has the Benefit of Cover).
    -&gt; If one or more models in this unit are each equipped with one weapon named "Kustom Mega-kannon", that unit gains the Kustom Mega-kannon ability (this unit is zapped; while the unit is zapped, subtract 1 from this unit's Leadership characteristic).
    -&gt; If one or more models in this unit are each equipped with one weapon named "Smasha Gun", that unit gains the Smasha Gun ability (this unit is smashed; while the unit is smashed, subtract 2 from this unit's Move characteristic).
    -&gt; If one or more models in this unit are each equipped with one weapon named "Traktor Kannon", that unit gains the Traktor Kannon ability (this unit is grounded; while the unit is grounded, this unit loses the Take to the Skies rule).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
