        <profile name="Fuel-mixa Grot" id="b42d-cd00-6c9f-c8cf" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gets +1 to Advance rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Get Back in da Race!" id="8bda-41d9-e7b4-4cf5" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit starts a move, you may use this ability or when the unit ends a move, you may use this ability, during the Movement phase, in your turn, until the start of your next turn:
  -&gt; Select one friendly SPEED FREEKS unit within 6" of the unit:
    -&gt; That unit is no longer Battle-shocked.
    -&gt; Friendly units embarked within that unit are no longer Battle-shocked.
    -&gt; That unit is riled up.
    -&gt; Friendly units embarked within that unit are riled up.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="1c82-9678-f386-9c94" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="5969-1bc4-9c4d-dc71" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
