      <profiles>
        <profile name="Kill Rig" id="3a64-53ed-89d3-2c82" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">10"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">3+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">16</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">109x170mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Beastscent" id="5ae8-1ad1-9506-d003" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When a friendly unit is selected to make a Disembark move, you may use this ability, during the Movement phase, in your turn, while the unit is not Battle-shocked, until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; Roll D6, then:
    -&gt; Roll one D6:
      - On 1: The unit is Battle-shocked.
      - On 2-6: Nothing happens.
  -&gt; Against MONSTER or VEHICLE targets, the triggering unit gets +1 to Wound rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Warpath" id="7971-f25d-1c87-7a07" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit is selected to fight, you may use this ability, during the Fight phase, while the unit is not Battle-shocked, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Roll D6, then:
    -&gt; Roll one D6:
      - On 1: The unit is Battle-shocked.
      - On 2-6: Nothing happens.
  -&gt; Melee weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [LETHAL HITS] and [PSYCHIC].</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Wurrboy (psyker level 1)" id="c377-32d7-bd0d-86d3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Nothing happens.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="62a7-9659-9c50-540d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="0f7e-5f31-2a1f-b037" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Feel No Pain" id="99c7-d68c-a378-af39" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit has the Feel No Pain X+ ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
