        <profile name="Burna-bommer" id="f268-16f2-29da-15cf" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">3+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">92x120mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Burna Bomb" id="4a1e-f871-562c-10ec" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of your opponent's Fight phase, until the end of your next turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit (excluding MONSTER or VEHICLE units) without the Lone Operative ability visible to this model if the selected unit is within 36" of the unit:
    -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 2+, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; that unit is marked as unhideable; each time a ranged attack targets that unit, the attacking weapon has [IGNORES COVER].</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="6bf1-0ac1-605c-7e35" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="ef94-5096-ef09-b655" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
