        <profile name="Even More Dakka" id="3404-6e1a-08e3-47b2" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the unit is riled up, ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1].</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="659e-2848-6e15-4b0a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
