      <profiles>
        <profile name="Squig Barrage" id="40a5-7d0c-be98-81a9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the start of your next turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit (excluding MONSTER or VEHICLE units) that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit by Squig Launchas during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; That unit is marked as covered in squigs.
    -&gt; While the selected unit is tagged covered in squigs, that unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="8bb3-a36b-8117-5047" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
