      <profiles>
        <profile name="Bust 'Em" id="480d-5015-4a1c-f2b7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; That unit is marked as busted.
    -&gt; While the target is tagged busted, all friendly SPEED FREEKS units' weapons gain [LETHAL HITS].</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Speednob Support" id="45bf-069f-08da-b5a0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While every model in the unit is within 3" of a friendly SPEED FREEKS unit (excluding WARTRAKK units) other than this unit, the unit gains the Lone Operative ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
