              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If the Transport this unit is embarked within has the TRANSPORT keyword, unless the Transport this unit is embarked within has the WALKER keyword, while the unit is embarked:
  -&gt; Add 2 to the Transport this unit is embarked within's Move characteristic.
  -&gt; The Transport this unit is embarked within has a 5+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
