              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is within 3" of a friendly ORKS WALKER unit (excluding BIG MEK units), this model gains the Lone Operative ability.
-&gt; Until the end of the turn: while this model is within 3" of a friendly ORKS WALKER unit (excluding BIG MEK units), during the Shooting phase, in your turn, select one friendly ORKS WALKER unit if the selected unit is within 3" of this model: you can re-roll a Hit roll of 1 for attacks made by that unit.
