              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, until the start of your next turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; That unit is infested with Snotlings.
    -&gt; While an enemy unit is infested with Snotlings, that unit gets -1 to Leadership rolls.
Applies to: units with BIG MEK WITH SHOKK ATTACK GUN.</characteristic>
